<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<task id="020" project="spaarkeai-mcp-bff-api-r2">
  <metadata>
    <title>Shared tool plumbing: general McpToolResults, start/status helper, per-area MCP ledger files</title>
    <phase>1 Read tools</phase>
    <gate>BLOCKED until spaarkeai-mcp-bff-api-r1 PR #3161 and r1 task 042 have merged to master and master is merged into this branch (merge, never rebase)</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies the shared MCP host code and the ArchTest ledger (tests/**); every later tool depends on it</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>New shared abstraction (long-running start/status contract) and a restructure of an auth guard ledger that every later task edits; mistakes propagate to ~17 tools</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>E</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Owns Api/Mcp/McpToolResults.cs, the new Api/Mcp/McpLongRunning.cs and the ledger files; 021 is client-only, so the two run together</parallel-reason>
    <deps>001</deps>
    <tags>bff-api, api, refactoring, testing</tags>
    <estimated-effort>4-6 hours</estimated-effort>
  </metadata>

  <prompt>Prepare r1's MCP host for ~17 more tools: generalise McpToolResults beyond DecisionToolError (any reasonCode/status/message), add the shared FR-14 start/status helper ({runId, status, consoleLink} within 30 s), split the McpTools ledger in RouteAuthorizationGuardTests.Mcp.cs into per-area partial files so parallel tool tasks never edit one array, clear the "Api/Agent" comment in DecisionsTextSummary.cs, and update HOW-TO-ADD-AN-MCP-TOOL.md. No decision-tool behaviour changes.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Follow ADRs strictly. Expert in the ModelContextProtocol C# SDK and the Spaarke route-authorization guard.</role>
  <goal>McpToolResults.FromError works for any tool error type with byte-identical output for decision tools; McpLongRunning returns the FR-14 start result and status result shapes; the ledger is one partial file per area (Decisions plus empty Search, Documents, Playbooks, Analysis, Tasks, Portfolio, Briefing, MatterSummary, Finance, Email) and the guard still sees every tool; all r1 MCP tests pass unchanged.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Spec FR-14 (shared long-running code), FR "Tools" (errors through the generalised McpToolResults). Today McpToolResults.FromError (Api/Mcp/McpToolResults.cs, 43 lines at 37f0864afe) takes DecisionToolError only. The MCP tool ledger is the McpTools array in tests/Spaarke.ArchTests/RouteAuthorizationGuardTests.Mcp.cs; uac-r2 reviews its restructure. The legacy agent's start/poll shape (deleted by 001) is readable with git show 37f0864afe:src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Agent/AgentEndpoints.cs (:461-481) and PlaybookStatusEndpoints.cs. r1 may change these files before #3161 merges: re-read them after the master merge; the line numbers here are from 37f0864afe.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Mcp/McpToolResults.cs (add a general McpToolError record (ReasonCode, Message, Status, Partial?) and FromError overload; DecisionToolError maps onto it)</file>
      <file role="new">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Mcp/McpLongRunning.cs (static helper: Started(runId, status, consoleLink, summary) and Status(runId, state, progress?, result?) CallToolResult builders plus the 30 s budget constant)</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Mcp/LegalOperations/Decisions/DecisionsTextSummary.cs (comment only: remove the "Api/Agent" mention)</file>
      <file role="modify">tests/Spaarke.ArchTests/RouteAuthorizationGuardTests.Mcp.cs (keep the guard logic; McpTools becomes the concatenation of per-area partial arrays)</file>
      <file role="new">tests/Spaarke.ArchTests/RouteAuthorizationGuardTests.Mcp.Decisions.cs (r1's rows moved verbatim)</file>
      <file role="new">tests/Spaarke.ArchTests/RouteAuthorizationGuardTests.Mcp.{Search,Documents,Playbooks,Analysis,Tasks,Portfolio,Briefing,MatterSummary,Finance,Email}.cs (empty arrays, one per later tool task)</file>
      <file role="new">tests/integration/contract/Api/Mcp/McpToolResultsGeneralTests.cs</file>
      <file role="new">tests/integration/contract/Api/Mcp/McpLongRunningTests.cs</file>
      <file role="modify">docs/guides/HOW-TO-ADD-AN-MCP-TOOL.md (general error type, long-running helper, per-area ledger file)</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">tests/integration/contract/Api/Mcp/ShowDecisionsToolTests.cs (decision error bytes to keep)</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Mcp/LegalOperations/Decisions/DecisionToolCall.cs</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="001" status="pending">Agent code removed (the old start/poll shape is read from history)</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">BLOCKED until r1 PR #3161 and r1 task 042 are merged to master and master is merged into this branch (merge, never rebase). Re-read every r1 file before editing; if r1 has already generalised McpToolResults or split the ledger, adopt r1's shape and record it.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-019">Decision-tool error results stay byte-identical (content text and structuredContent { reasonCode, message, status, correlationId?, partial? }); existing ShowDecisionsToolTests, PlanAndLookupToolTests and McpHostContractTests pass unchanged. Errors stay isError tool results, never transport errors.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">McpLongRunning's start result is structuredContent { runId, status, consoleLink } plus a one-line text summary; the status result is { runId, status (queued|running|completed|failed), progress?, result? }; the consoleLink is built from an existing deep-link helper (HandoffUrlBuilder, relocated by 001 to Services/Ai/Handoff/, or Services/Todo/IDeepLinkBuilder), not a hand-built URL; no polling loop or background work in the helper (ADR-052).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">The ledger split is mechanical: the guard's assertion set is unchanged, the concatenated array equals r1's rows, and a test proves a tool class missing from every partial still fails the guard (must-fire) while all r1 tools pass (must-not-fire). uac-r2 reviews the diff.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-029">Every change this task makes under src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/ is listed in the PR with a Placement Justification that cites .claude/constraints/bff-extensions.md (source: spec.md 'Placement &amp; New Components'), and the PR records the publish-size delta against a fresh master build per .claude/constraints/azure-deployment.md 'BFF Publish-Size Per-Task Verification Rule': +5 MB or more needs explicit justification, 55 MB total triggers architecture review, 60 MB is a hard stop. No new HIGH CVE (dotnet list package --vulnerable --include-transitive).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">Every test this task adds lives on a KEEP path (tests/integration/{auth,contract,regression,data-mutation}/** or tests/unit/domain/**) or is an ArchTest, mocks only at module boundaries, and uses no Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt; or Mock&lt;IServiceClient&gt;.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Before each push run bash scripts/quality/check-changed-cs-format.sh origin/master. CS0618 is a build error: migrate, never suppress.</constraint>
  </constraints>

